Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:11.90,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68} 年 {\fs78}10{\fs68} 月 {\fs78}26{\fs68} 日 巴塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:13.38,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9000{\fs68}名观众起立
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:15.57,TL,,0,0,0,,掌声响了三分多钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:20.29,TL,,0,0,0,,一个从没在这座球场拿过冠军的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:22.50,TL,,0,0,0,,这一夜是全场的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:25.18,TL,,0,0,0,,这一夜没有比赛 这是瑞士网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:28.13,TL,,0,0,0,,为斯坦 瓦林卡办的告别仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:31.03,TL,,0,0,0,,布伦瓦尔德送了他一颗金色的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:33.27,TL,,0,0,0,,叫他网球界的史泰龙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:37.03,TL,,0,0,0,,而这里 也是他职业生涯的最后一站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:40.92,TL,,0,0,0,,主持人端来一盘爆米花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:43.63,TL,,0,0,0,,他笑着选了爆米花 没选香蕉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:47.54,TL,,0,0,0,,坐下来 看大屏幕上放自己的{\fs78}24{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:51.27,TL,,0,0,0,,和费德勒同为瑞士人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:52.65,TL,,0,0,0,,是 另一个瑞士人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:55.66,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}28{\fs68}岁才第一次打进年终前{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:00:57.23,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}次大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.52,TL,,0,0,0,,对面站的全是世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68} 他全赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:03.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68} 年第四次决赛 输给纳达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:06.23,TL,,0,0,0,,之后他膝盖连做两次手术
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:08.36,TL,,0,0,0,,排名跌到第{\fs78}263{\fs68}位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:11.06,TL,,0,0,0,,他又爬回来 打到了{\fs78}41{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:13.18,TL,,0,0,0,,他的左臂上纹着一句话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:16.66,TL,,0,0,0,,再试 再败 败得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:22.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Federer a gagné vingt Grands Chelems, Wawrinka trois.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费德勒{\fs78}20{\fs68}冠 瓦林卡{\fs78}3{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:24.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}En Suisse, on parle de Roger.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在瑞士 人们只谈罗杰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:27.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Dans n'importe quel autre pays, ce serait incroyable, ce que Stan a accompli.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在任何别的国家 这都不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:31.07,TL,,0,0,0,,第一个出现的 是费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:34.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Je te souhaite le meilleur.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N祝你一切都好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.17,0:01:37.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Un petit mot en français, comme ça tu me comprends aussi.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用一点法语说 你也能听懂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:40.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Je pense à toi, tu me manques, je t'aime, mon gars.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我惦记你 想念你 我爱你 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:44.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Et enjoy le moment à Bâle, chez moi, à Bâle.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在我家乡巴塞尔 享受这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:45.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Allez, à bientôt, ciao ciao.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N加油 后会有期 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.90,0:01:48.24,TL,,0,0,0,,穆雷 威兰德 纳芙拉蒂洛娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:49.77,TL,,0,0,0,,蒙菲尔斯依次出现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.77,0:01:52.84,TL,,0,0,0,,德约科维奇干脆就坐在观众席里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:56.48,TL,,0,0,0,,麦肯罗的致辞 只有一句最戳人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:03.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Stan, I got to tell you, man, congratulations on an amazing Hall of Fame career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯坦 恭喜你这名人堂级的生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:07.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You're going to be there in five years or however long it takes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N五年之后 你会在名人堂里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:10.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You've been an inspiration to a lot of players.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你激励了很多球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:14.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thank you for showing that the one-handed backhand can still do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢你证明 单反依然能登顶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:17.50,TL,,0,0,0,,最后播出的 是他父母的视频
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:20.36,TL,,0,0,0,,镜头扫过 瓦林卡低下了头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:22.08,TL,,0,0,0,,全场最吵的一夜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:24.22,TL,,0,0,0,,在那一刻最安静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.45,TL,,0,0,0,,轮到他自己致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:29.04,TL,,0,0,0,,他先谢了布伦瓦尔德
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:32.13,TL,,0,0,0,,这站比赛 他打了{\fs78}19{\fs68}届 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:35.43,TL,,0,0,0,,他讲了一句让全场大笑的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:40.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}On voulait te remercier pour ce tournoi.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们想谢谢你 谢谢这站比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:43.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Malheureusement, je n'ai jamais réussi à le gagner.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可惜的是 我从来没能赢下它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Roger est passé plus d'une fois ici, donc ça a été plus compliqué.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N罗杰来过不止一次 所以更难了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Mais mes meilleurs souvenirs, pour moi,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但对我来说 最好的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:51.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}pour pouvoir terminer ici, en Suisse, c'est un rêve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是能在瑞士收官 像一场梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:54.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}C'est un rêve, après plus de vingt ans de carrière,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二十多年职业生涯之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:57.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}finir une dernière fois à la maison, sur un tel tournoi.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后一次在家乡的这项大赛收官
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:02:59.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}C'est exceptionnel. Merci beaucoup.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太特别了 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:01.29,TL,,0,0,0,,最后 他绕场一周
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:02.79,TL,,0,0,0,,手机灯光亮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:05.19,TL,,0,0,0,,像给他点了一场星海
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:07.63,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68} 年 {\fs78}12{\fs68} 月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.22,TL,,0,0,0,,他宣布退役时写道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.51,TL,,0,0,0,,每本书都需要一个结局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.51,0:03:13.17,TL,,0,0,0,,瑞士人把这个结局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:15.34,TL,,0,0,0,,写成了一场庆典
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:20.37,TL,,0,0,0,,试过 败过 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:23.68,TL,,0,0,0,,再试 再败 败得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:26.21,TL,,0,0,0,,而在巴塞尔当地 {\fs78}10{\fs68} 月 {\fs78}27{\fs68} 日晚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.21,0:03:27.96,TL,,0,0,0,,他还要走进这座球场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:30.19,TL,,0,0,0,,打职业生涯的最后一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:32.19,TL,,0,0,0,,或者 还不止一场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.19,0:03:35.03,TL,,0,0,0,,这一战 你希望他赢吗？
